    {
        "id":"nocmar_complete_5",
        "message":"There was a time, before all this, when I had a place. A house. Not just any house...a white house on the edge of Fallhaven, glowing as if lit by the gods themselves. That glow comes from the forge inside. A forge unlike any other, always hot, always ready. It was there that I forged heartsteel in secret, while the shopfront stayed clean for coin and trade.",
        "switchToNPC":"nocmar",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"Wait, that's your house?",
                "nextPhraseID":"nocmar_white_house_10",
                "requires":[
